{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colorful code-guessing puzzle game where you must decipher the correct combination of gumballs to solve the puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step up to the gumball machine and test your logic skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this color based guessing game your goal is to crack the code of the gumballs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll make guesses and receive hints to help you along getting the right combination, with each guess getting closes to the winning combination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're playing to casually unwind, challenge yourself to a new difficulty, or beat your best solve, this game will deliver a sweet satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crack the code and get popping!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3849610?t=1753157073","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849610/87a0eebff482369632b65322c92cf564a1c692be/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753157073","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849610/b0c417bb1d790e86cb5e060ab83f0380e6a11be1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753157073","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849610/b0c417bb1d790e86cb5e060ab83f0380e6a11be1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753157073","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colorful code-guessing puzzle game where you must decipher the correct combination of gumballs to solve the puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step up to the gumball machine and test your logic skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this color based guessing game your goal is to crack the code of the gumballs.</p>